  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Sitting on an exclusive site in elite Stanley Point, this is a section you would not expect to find . A property with a part dilapidated home, this is the opportunity to build afresh. Seldom is this chance available in this location  with such close city and water views.\r\n \r\nStanley Bay Park and Beach and even a Croquet club is just down the road. Devonport village and ferry to the central city is only a few minutes drive away. Build your new home!  Then sit and relax with family and friends while enjoying these beautiful city views  larger than life where it's all happening day and night - right before your eyes.\r\n   \r\nThis is an opportunity we very seldom see in this superb location. It is here to be sold.",
